  /* =====================================================================================================================
     The Hi-Fi skin (Jam Cards 1.0.0): every card Hi-Fi does not draw itself (above) keeps its own DOM and gets the house
     language through these rules over the stable class hooks: Plex Mono labels, Jost words in mixed case, flat keys with a
     hairline (pressed = deeper paper + ink edge, never an accent fill), groove-and-fill strips like the faders, a hairline
     instead of the accent rules and tone stripes, no orange unless a card asks for it (the default accent is the ink), the
     red alert key with dark text, offline as a dashed outline, art in its own colours. Card-specific rules are scoped by
     :host(<tag>) so they never reach another card's root (every Hi-Fi-styled root adopts this sheet).
     ===================================================================================================================== */
